com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/d0366ae7536a78588ee0004109d07d01.webm?t=1769032467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/d0366ae7536a78588ee0004109d07d01.mp4?t=1769032467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/e4f73ce3fbff968adb624a42be9f6a3e.webp?t=1769032467\" width=126 height=33 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over +300 unique cards and effects!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over +100 enemies to encounter that have their own passive abilities, playing cards, and unique playstyle personalities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over +200 items (potions, artifacts, secrets) to help you explore the Crypt!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over +75 engaging and choice-filled Events!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three floors to conquer which are fully procedurally generated so no two runs feel the same!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in many different encounter types including: Combat, Shop, Treasure, Rest, Events, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various difficulty levels and run modifiers to further enhance your Crypt experience!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/f010100d494d09ad2f3fcc814529cf10.poster.avif?t=1769032467\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/f010100d494d09ad2f3fcc814529cf10.webm?t=1769032467\" type=\"video/webm; c